{"id":2127,"level":80,"name":"Майстерня зв’язок (3)","group":"Зв’язки","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>A pin party leverages the tactical motif of the pin, exploiting the weakness of a pinned piece. A pinned piece cannot perform its defensive duties effectively. As a result, you can suddenly capture material that seems defended but is not truly protected.</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":100,"examples":[{"fen":"2r3k1/1p4pp/2pb1q2/p2p4/3P4/P3P1P1/1P2Q1BP/2R3K1 w - - 0 23","pgn":"23. Bxd5+ * ","text":"<p>Чорний пішак c-шахів зв’язаний і тому не може ефективно виконувати свої оборонні обов’язки. У результаті білі виграють важливого пішака.</p><p><br></p>","format":27},{"fen":"3r1rk1/pp3p2/4p1p1/3qn2n/3pNB2/5Q2/PP2RP2/6RK w - - 0 29","pgn":"29. Qxh5 * ","text":"<p>Після того, як білий ферзь захопить чорного коня, чорні не можуть відбити назад через зв’язку вздовж надрізу g.</p><p><br></p>","format":27},{"fen":"2r1k2r/ppq2ppp/2nbpnb1/1B1pN3/Q2P1P2/2P5/PP1N2PP/R1B2RK1 w k - 0 1","pgn":"1. Qxa7 {[%csl Ga7,Gb5,Rc6,Re8][%cal Rc6a7,Gb5e8]} * ","text":"","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":78282,"fen":"2kr3r/2p1q1p1/1p3p2/p3pP1p/PnNpP1nP/1Q1P2P1/1P4B1/2R2RK1 w - - 0 24","pgn":"{[%csl Rc7,Rc8][%evp 0,1,44,25]} {Q=1} 24. Nxb6+ * ","format":27,"texts":["Зв’язані пішаки погано захищаються."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78288,"fen":"3r1r2/pp3pk1/2p1p1p1/4n2p/2n1Bq1P/1QP3N1/PP6/K3R1R1 w - - 0 26","pgn":"{[%csl Rg6,Rg7][%evp 0,3,906,949,979,953]} {Q=1} 26. Nxh5+ Kh8 {Q=2} 27. Nxf4 * ","format":27,"texts":["Зв’язані пішаки погано захищаються.","Час заробляти!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":80564,"fen":"1r1r2k1/4bpp1/4p2p/2pb4/p3Bq2/1PP2PN1/P3Q1PP/3R1R1K w - - 0 27","pgn":"{[%csl Re6][%evp 0,5,249,257,292,296,305,313]} 27. Bxd5 Rxd5 {[%csl Re6]} 28. Rxd5 exd5 {[%csl Re7]} 29. Qxe7 * ","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78283,"fen":"rnr3k1/p2nqppp/1pp5/3